{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eLUmGrT6Wr1795783114.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>廣西壯族自治區政府前主席藍天立，受賄五億多元人民幣，一審被判死緩。</p><p></p><p>案件在湖南省常德市中級人民法院宣判，藍天立被指在2008年至2025年，利用職務便利，為有關單位及個人在企業經營、項目承攬等事項提供幫助，非法收受財物，折合5.87億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.OFFICIAL-1830-1_CLEAN_20261127_203104_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iG4LHf3JTM1795783127.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>法院認為他的受賄數額特別巨大，論罪應當判處死刑，由於他有受賄未遂情節，認罪悔罪等，決定從輕處罰，判處其死刑，緩刑兩年執行，緩刑期滿後，依法減為無期徒刑，終身監禁，不得減刑及假釋，沒收個人全部財產。犯罪所得依法上繳國庫。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.OFFICIAL-1830-1_CLEAN_20261127_203104.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ntSHaZi2j91795783147.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T13:03:55.048093+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T23:17:36.051589+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:17.537514+00:00","content_hash":"28fc0205ee4ecb1c658d0a86e9c497d719c5cf788410200a15b83ab6a0f1f49b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}